sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant D as Daraja C2B
  participant API as Callback endpoint
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant W as Worker
  D->>API: confirmation (receipt, amount, BillRefNumber)
  API->>DB: TX1 validate structure, store raw payload and headers, commit
  API-->>D: 200 (after TX1 commits)
  API->>DB: TX2 match BillRefNumber (E.164, no fuzzy)
  alt active wallet
    DB->>DB: Dr 1000 Cr 2000, expected fee Dr 5000 Cr 2050
  else unmatched, malformed, closed
    DB->>DB: Dr 1000 Cr 2030, expected fee still posts
  end
  Note over API,DB: if TX2 fails, evidence stays marked pending
  W->>DB: reprocess pending evidence
  D->>API: duplicate (same receipt)
  API-->>D: 200, original outcome, no second credit
  D->>API: same receipt, different content
  API->>DB: store conflict evidence, open integrity exception
  API-->>D: 200
